    "subtitle": "Discovery of electron, proton & neutron, Thomson's & Rutherford's gold-foil models, Bohr's shells (K, L, M, N & 2n²), atomic number (Z) & mass number (A), electronic configuration, valency, isotopes & isobars!",
    "subtitleHinglish": "Electron-proton-neutron, Rutherford ka gold-foil prayog, Bohr ke K-L-M-N shells (2n²), Z aur A, electronic configuration, isotopes aur isobars Hinglish me!",
    "board": "BOTH",
