            "heading": "Next Steps in the Chapter",
            "headingHinglish": "Chapter ka agla kadam",
            "body": "Maya completed her greased-card data table and shared the findings with Dr. Higgins over the class portal: *\"Card A from the road was covered with heavy black soot and grit, whereas Card B from the garden had far fewer specks.\"*\n\nDr. Higgins replied: *\"An outstanding demonstration, Maya. Seeing those soot particles with your own eyes makes atmospheric pollution real. But remember: smog is not an inevitable fate of winter. In our final topic, we will see how engineering solutions — from catalytic converters and scrubbers to electric mobility and clean hydrogen — can eliminate these emissions at the source.\"*\n\nThree days later, a fresh weather front brought sweeping winds that swept through the valley, dismantling the inversion ceiling and scattering the haze. When school resumed, the students stepped onto campus with a deeper scientific understanding of the air around them.\n\n**What comes next?** In our final chapter topic, **\"Solutions for Clean Air: Technologies, Policy, and the Class 9 Chemistry Retrospective\"**, we will discover the engineering breakthroughs protecting our skies — including flue-gas scrubbers, electrostatic precipitators, catalytic converters, and green hydrogen — and conclude our complete journey through Class 9 Chemistry!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Aarvi ne apne card ke kan ginte aur likha: \"Sadak ke paas wala card park wale se kaafi gandha nikla.\" Mr. Gadre ne call par kaha, \"Aur ab tum samajh gayi ho ki smog sirf ek mausam ki baat nahi: ye chhote-chhote kanon aur gaason ki kahani hai, jinhe hum samajh kar kam kar sakte hain. Aur sabse achhi baat: **hawa saaf bhi ho sakti hai**, jaise ozone layer dheere-dheere thik ho rahi hai.\"\n\nKuch din baad hawa chali, smog chhata, aur school dobara khul gaya. Aarvi ne subah ki hawa mein gehri saans li.\n\n---\n\nShabaash! Tumne smog, PM2.5, carbon monoxide aur sehat ke asar ko samajh liya, aur ek safe dust test bhi seekh liya.\n\n**Aage kya?** Agle topic mein (Topic 6) hum dekhenge **saaf hawa ke upay**: BS-VI eendhan, CNG aur electric gaadiyaan, catalytic converter, chimney ke scrubbers, solar aur hydrogen, aur tumhare apne **\"my pollution diary\"** wali activity. Saath hi poore chapter ka saar aur **Class 9 Chemistry ka safar** bhi hoga."
